============================================================
28. VALIDATION
============================================================

Validate inputs.

Examples:

Income:

must be > 0 if entered.

Expenses:

must be >= 0.

Savings:

must be >= 0.

Investment:

must be >= 0.

Loan EMI:

must be >= 0.

Target amount:

must be > 0.

Do not allow invalid values.

Show concise inline errors.

Do not use alert() for normal validation.

============================================================
29. MONEY INPUT
============================================================

All money inputs use:

₹

Indian number formatting.

Examples:

₹75,000

₹2,50,000

₹12,50,000

Do not store formatted strings as the actual numeric value.

Store numeric values.

Format only for display.

