48. FINAL ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
============================================================

The implementation is complete only when:

✓ New users are taken to Financial Profile Setup after registration/login.

✓ Setup uses a clean stepper UI.

✓ Each screen has minimal fields.

✓ Advanced fields are hidden until requested.

✓ Users can skip optional sections.

✓ Users can go back.

✓ Users can exit and resume later.

✓ Progress is visible.

✓ Completion percentage is calculated dynamically.

✓ 70% is configurable.

✓ Users below threshold are reminded but NOT blocked.

✓ Users above threshold are not unnecessarily prompted.

✓ Dismissed reminders do not repeatedly appear during the same session.

✓ ProfileScreen displays completion status.

✓ Missing sections can be opened directly.

✓ No sensitive credentials are requested.

✓ No account numbers are requested.

✓ No passwords are requested.

✓ No OTPs are requested.

✓ No PINs are requested.

✓ No CVV is requested.

✓ Money values use INR formatting.

✓ Missing data is not represented as fake zero values.

✓ Existing theme is preserved.

✓ Existing navigation is preserved.

✓ Existing authentication is preserved.

✓ Existing screens are not broken.

✓ No backend changes are made.

✓ No unnecessary dependencies are added.

✓ TypeScript compilation passes.

✓ Existing frontend tests continue to pass.

